      "start_seconds": 67.19,
      "end_seconds": 79.6,
      "duration_seconds": 12.41,
      "text": "okay: height 176 centimetres saturation 99 percent heart rate 83 blood pressure 120 over 76 BMI works out to 18.4 weight 57 kilos temperature 36.9. Alright since when exactly?"
