      "start_seconds": 365.99,
      "end_seconds": 379.85,
      "duration_seconds": 13.86,
      "text": "all finished thank you. Okay so my impression is this: I don't have a clear answer today: an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up is possible and so is a chronic infection"
