      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 384.54,
      "end_seconds": 406.39,
      "duration_seconds": 21.85,
      "text": "I can't promise yet but most people with an unexplained weight loss that needs a proper work-up do well once it's treated properly we should do a thyroid test for weight loss let's book blood tests to look into weight loss we should do a chest X-ray for cough and weight loss"
    },
