      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 414.64,
      "end_seconds": 439.48,
      "duration_seconds": 24.84,
      "text": "Weigh yourself once a week at the same time and note it down. The chest clinic would be the right next step, I'll refer you. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. See me again in two weeks. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
